
UrbanRays Project Documentation
______________________________________________________________________________________________

----Overview----
UrbanRays is a React.js project designed for online shopping, focusing on sunglasses, shoes, and bags. It incorporates various technologies for efficient state management, data security, user authentication, form handling, UI design, and animation.

----Technologies Used ----
> React.js
  React.js is utilized as the primary frontend library for building reusable UI components and managing the application's view layer.

> Redux
  Redux is employed for state management, allowing for a centralized store to manage application state across components efficiently.

> LocalStorage
  LocalStorage is utilized for client-side data persistence, enabling the application to store user data locally within the browser.

> CryptoJS
  CryptoJS is used for data encryption, ensuring secure transmission and storage of sensitive user information such as passwords and payment details.
 
> Auth0
  Auth0 is integrated for user authentication, providing secure and seamless login functionality to authenticate users and manage user sessions.
 
> Formik
  Formik is utilized for form handling, simplifying the process of building and managing forms within the application.
 
> Material UI
  Material UI is incorporated for designing the user interface, providing pre-designed React components and themes for a polished and responsive UI.
 
> AOS Animation
  AOS (Animate On Scroll) animation library is utilized to add smooth animations to elements as they come into view during scrolling, enhancing the user experience and visual appeal of the application.

> Slick Slider
  Slick Slider is integrated to create interactive and responsive image carousels and sliders, allowing users to browse through product images with ease.

> React Router 6
  React Router 6 is used for client-side routing, enabling navigation between different pages and components within the application without full page reloads.

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________

Features --

. Product Listings: Displays a variety of sunglasses, shoes, and bags for users to browse and purchase.
. User Authentication: Implements Auth0 for user authentication, allowing users to securely log in and access their accounts.
. State Management: Utilizes Redux for managing application state, ensuring data consistency and efficient state updates across components.
. Data Encryption: Incorporates CryptoJS for encrypting sensitive user data, ensuring secure transmission and storage.
. Local Data Storage: Utilizes LocalStorage for storing user data locally within the browser, providing persistence across sessions.
. Form Handling: Implements Formik for simplifying form creation and management, enhancing the user experience when interacting with input forms.
. UI Design: Utilizes Material UI for designing a polished and responsive user interface, enhancing the overall look and feel of the application.
. Animation: Integrates AOS animation library to add smooth animations to elements during scrolling, improving the visual appeal of the application.
. Image Carousel: Incorporates Slick Slider to create interactive and responsive image carousels for showcasing product images.
. Routing: Utilizes React Router 6 for client-side routing, enabling seamless navigation between different pages and components within the application.

